{"id":"0ba8f021ca287877","group":"16","path":"16/16-df-comprehension-category.md","title":"理解范畴","display":"df-comprehension-category — 理解范畴","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","label":"16-df-comprehension-category","aliases":["16-df-comprehension-category","Comprehension category"],"display":"df-comprehension-category — 理解范畴","depends_on":["[[16-df-fibration]]","[[16-df-category]]","[[16-df-functor]]","[[16-df-pullback-square]]","[[16-df-cartesian-morphism]]"],"source":"Definition 1.1.5 p.28 (PDF48); Definition 10.4.2 and Notation 10.4.3 pp.613–614 (PDF633–634); explicit arrow-category encoding","revision_date":"2026-10-20"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"label","html":"16-df-comprehension-category"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-df-comprehension-category</span><span>Comprehension category</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-comprehension-category — 理解范畴"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c9801f31ec8ac53f\" href=\"?note=c9801f31ec8ac53f\" title=\"16-df-fibration\">16-df-fibration</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"25a281534aa42440\" href=\"?note=25a281534aa42440\" title=\"16-df-category\">16-df-category</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"fc49efccd7348d66\" href=\"?note=fc49efccd7348d66\" title=\"16-df-functor\">16-df-functor</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"dacf0503b95c88a9\" href=\"?note=dacf0503b95c88a9\" title=\"16-df-pullback-square\">16-df-pullback-square</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"427be4d627513590\" href=\"?note=427be4d627513590\" title=\"16-df-cartesian-morphism\">16-df-cartesian-morphism</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"Definition 1.1.5 p.28 (PDF48); Definition 10.4.2 and Notation 10.4.3 pp.613–614 (PDF633–634); explicit arrow-category encoding"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-20"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B\">\\(p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B^{\\to}\">\\(\\chi:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B^{\\to}\\)</span> 为函子，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"fc49efccd7348d66\" href=\"?note=fc49efccd7348d66\" title=\"16-df-functor\">16-df-functor</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B^\\to\">\\(\\mathcal B^\\to\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{cod}\">\\(\\operatorname{cod}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{dom}\">\\(\\operatorname{dom}\\)</span> 在下文按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"25a281534aa42440\" href=\"?note=25a281534aa42440\" title=\"16-df-category\">16-df-category</a> 的六元组构造；不要求 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B\">\\(\\mathcal B\\)</span> 有所有拉回。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s,t,e,c\">\\(s,t,e,c\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B\">\\(\\mathcal B\\)</span> 的结构映射。交换方块带源靶标签 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle d,d&#39;,a,b\\rangle\">\\(\\langle d,d&#39;,a,b\\rangle\\)</span>，在固定 Hom 内可简写 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(a,b):d\\to d&#39;\">\\((a,b):d\\to d&#39;\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi_X,\\{X\\},\\{f\\}\">\\(\\pi_X,\\{X\\},\\{f\\}\\)</span> 由下文从 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi\">\\(\\chi\\)</span> 的对象/箭头分量取出；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,Y\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E\">\\(X,Y\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:X\\to Y\">\\(f:X\\to Y\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cat}\">\\(\\mathrm{Cat}\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"25a281534aa42440\" href=\"?note=25a281534aa42440\" title=\"16-df-category\">16-df-category</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cartesian}\">\\(\\mathrm{Cartesian}\\)</span> 的定义及结构参数见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"427be4d627513590\" href=\"?note=427be4d627513590\" title=\"16-df-cartesian-morphism\">16-df-cartesian-morphism</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CompCat}\">\\(\\mathrm{CompCat}\\)</span> 为本原子定义的记号，其结构参数与完整条件在下文给出。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fib}\">\\(\\mathrm{Fib}\\)</span> 的定义及结构参数见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"c9801f31ec8ac53f\" href=\"?note=c9801f31ec8ac53f\" title=\"16-df-fibration\">16-df-fibration</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PbSq}\">\\(\\mathrm{PbSq}\\)</span> 的定义及结构参数见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"dacf0503b95c88a9\" href=\"?note=dacf0503b95c88a9\" title=\"16-df-pullback-square\">16-df-pullback-square</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Functor}\">\\(\\mathrm{Functor}\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"fc49efccd7348d66\" href=\"?note=fc49efccd7348d66\" title=\"16-df-functor\">16-df-functor</a> 的带源、靶范畴参数谓词。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nO_\\to&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Mor}\\mathcal B,\\\\\nM_\\to&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\langle d,d&#39;,a,b\\rangle\\mid d,d&#39;\\in O_\\to\\land\na\\in\\mathcal B(sd,sd&#39;)\\land b\\in\\mathcal B(td,td&#39;)\\land d&#39;a=bd\\},\\\\\ns_\\to\\langle d,d&#39;,a,b\\rangle&amp;\\coloneqq d,\\qquad\nt_\\to\\langle d,d&#39;,a,b\\rangle\\coloneqq d&#39;,\\\\\ne_\\to(d)&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle d,d,e(sd),e(td)\\rangle,\\\\\nc_\\to(\\langle d&#39;,d&#39;&#39;,a&#39;,b&#39;\\rangle,\\langle d,d&#39;,a,b\\rangle)\n&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle d,d&#39;&#39;,c(a&#39;,a),c(b&#39;,b)\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathcal B^\\to&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle O_\\to,M_\\to,s_\\to,t_\\to,e_\\to,c_\\to\\rangle,\\\\\n\\operatorname{dom}_0(d)&amp;\\coloneqq sd,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{dom}_1\\langle d,d&#39;,a,b\\rangle\\coloneqq a,\\\\\n\\operatorname{cod}_0(d)&amp;\\coloneqq td,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{cod}_1\\langle d,d&#39;,a,b\\rangle\\coloneqq b,\\\\\n\\operatorname{dom}&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle\\operatorname{dom}_0,\\operatorname{dom}_1\\rangle,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{cod}\\coloneqq\\langle\\operatorname{cod}_0,\\operatorname{cod}_1\\rangle,\\\\\n\\pi_X&amp;\\coloneqq\\chi X,\\qquad\\{X\\}\\coloneqq\\operatorname{dom}_0(\\chi X),\\qquad\n\\{f\\}\\coloneqq\\operatorname{dom}_1(\\chi f),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Cat}(\\mathcal B^\\to)&amp;,\\qquad\n\\mathrm{Functor}(\\operatorname{dom},\\mathcal B^\\to,\\mathcal B),\\qquad\n\\mathrm{Functor}(\\operatorname{cod},\\mathcal B^\\to,\\mathcal B).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nO_\\to&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Mor}\\mathcal B,\\\\\nM_\\to&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\langle d,d&#39;,a,b\\rangle\\mid d,d&#39;\\in O_\\to\\land\na\\in\\mathcal B(sd,sd&#39;)\\land b\\in\\mathcal B(td,td&#39;)\\land d&#39;a=bd\\},\\\\\ns_\\to\\langle d,d&#39;,a,b\\rangle&amp;\\coloneqq d,\\qquad\nt_\\to\\langle d,d&#39;,a,b\\rangle\\coloneqq d&#39;,\\\\\ne_\\to(d)&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle d,d,e(sd),e(td)\\rangle,\\\\\nc_\\to(\\langle d&#39;,d&#39;&#39;,a&#39;,b&#39;\\rangle,\\langle d,d&#39;,a,b\\rangle)\n&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle d,d&#39;&#39;,c(a&#39;,a),c(b&#39;,b)\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathcal B^\\to&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle O_\\to,M_\\to,s_\\to,t_\\to,e_\\to,c_\\to\\rangle,\\\\\n\\operatorname{dom}_0(d)&amp;\\coloneqq sd,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{dom}_1\\langle d,d&#39;,a,b\\rangle\\coloneqq a,\\\\\n\\operatorname{cod}_0(d)&amp;\\coloneqq td,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{cod}_1\\langle d,d&#39;,a,b\\rangle\\coloneqq b,\\\\\n\\operatorname{dom}&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle\\operatorname{dom}_0,\\operatorname{dom}_1\\rangle,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{cod}\\coloneqq\\langle\\operatorname{cod}_0,\\operatorname{cod}_1\\rangle,\\\\\n\\pi_X&amp;\\coloneqq\\chi X,\\qquad\\{X\\}\\coloneqq\\operatorname{dom}_0(\\chi X),\\qquad\n\\{f\\}\\coloneqq\\operatorname{dom}_1(\\chi f),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Cat}(\\mathcal B^\\to)&amp;,\\qquad\n\\mathrm{Functor}(\\operatorname{dom},\\mathcal B^\\to,\\mathcal B),\\qquad\n\\mathrm{Functor}(\\operatorname{cod},\\mathcal B^\\to,\\mathcal B).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}comprehension\\text{-}category}\\vdash\\quad \\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{CompCat}(p,\\chi)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Fib}(p)\\land\\operatorname{cod}\\chi=p\\\\\n&amp;\\land(\\forall X,Y\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E)\n(\\forall f\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(X,Y))\\bigl(\\mathrm{Cartesian}_p(f)\\Rightarrow\n\\mathrm{PbSq}_{\\mathcal B}(\\{f\\},\\pi_X;\\pi_Y,pf)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}comprehension\\text{-}category}\\vdash\\quad \\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{CompCat}(p,\\chi)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Fib}(p)\\land\\operatorname{cod}\\chi=p\\\\\n&amp;\\land(\\forall X,Y\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E)\n(\\forall f\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(X,Y))\\bigl(\\mathrm{Cartesian}_p(f)\\Rightarrow\n\\mathrm{PbSq}_{\\mathcal B}(\\{f\\},\\pi_X;\\pi_Y,pf)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>箭头范畴的单位与复合逐分量定义；基范畴单位律、结合律给出其范畴公理，两个分量投影保持这些运算，故 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{dom},\\operatorname{cod}\">\\(\\operatorname{dom},\\operatorname{cod}\\)</span> 是函子。完整标签与 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"83660625186c7ee3\" href=\"?note=83660625186c7ee3\" title=\"16-df-codomain-fibration\">16-df-codomain-fibration</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"53dadf7eff1efeea\" href=\"?note=53dadf7eff1efeea\" title=\"16-df-display-fibration\">16-df-display-fibration</a> 的编码一致；此构造本身不需要拉回。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>只要求理解方块中相关拉回存在，不预设基范畴有一切拉回。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>定义不包含满忠实性或基终对象；这些分别在 full comprehension 和闭理解结构中加入。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{-\\}=\\operatorname{dom}\\chi\">\\(\\{-\\}=\\operatorname{dom}\\chi\\)</span> 是上下文扩张函子。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>来源：Jacobs, <em>Categorical Logic and Type Theory</em>，Definition 10.4.2 and Notation 10.4.3, pp. 613–614 (PDF 633–634)。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-fibration","status":"resolved","id":"c9801f31ec8ac53f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-fibration]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-category","status":"resolved","id":"25a281534aa42440","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-category]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-functor","status":"resolved","id":"fc49efccd7348d66","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-functor]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-pullback-square","status":"resolved","id":"dacf0503b95c88a9","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-pullback-square]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-cartesian-morphism","status":"resolved","id":"427be4d627513590","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-cartesian-morphism]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-functor","status":"resolved","id":"fc49efccd7348d66","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B$ 与 $\\chi:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B^{\\to}$ 为函子，见 [[16-df-functor]]。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-category","status":"resolved","id":"25a281534aa42440","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal B^\\to$、$\\operatorname{cod}$、$\\operatorname{dom}$ 在下文按 [[16-df-category]] 的六元组构造；不要求 $\\mathcal B$ 有所有拉回。$s,t,e,c$ 是 $\\mathcal B$ 的结构映射。交换方块带源靶标签 $\\langle d,d',a,b\\rangle$，在固定 Hom 内可简写 $(a,b):d\\to d'$。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-category","status":"resolved","id":"25a281534aa42440","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\pi_X,\\{X\\},\\{f\\}$ 由下文从 $\\chi$ 的对象/箭头分量取出；$X,Y\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E$，$f:X\\to Y$。$\\mathrm{Cat}$ 采用 [[16-df-category]]。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-cartesian-morphism","status":"resolved","id":"427be4d627513590","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Cartesian}$ 的定义及结构参数见 [[16-df-cartesian-morphism]]。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-fibration","status":"resolved","id":"c9801f31ec8ac53f","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Fib}$ 的定义及结构参数见 [[16-df-fibration]]。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-pullback-square","status":"resolved","id":"dacf0503b95c88a9","anchor":"ref-11","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PbSq}$ 的定义及结构参数见 [[16-df-pullback-square]]。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-functor","status":"resolved","id":"fc49efccd7348d66","anchor":"ref-12","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Functor}$ 采用 [[16-df-functor]] 的带源、靶范畴参数谓词。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-codomain-fibration","status":"resolved","id":"83660625186c7ee3","anchor":"ref-13","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"箭头范畴的单位与复合逐分量定义；基范畴单位律、结合律给出其范畴公理，两个分量投影保持这些运算，故 $\\operatorname{dom},\\operatorname{cod}$ 是函子。完整标签与 [[16-df-codomain-fibration]]、[[16-df-display-fibration]] 的编码一致；此构造本身不需要拉回。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-display-fibration","status":"resolved","id":"53dadf7eff1efeea","anchor":"ref-14","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"箭头范畴的单位与复合逐分量定义；基范畴单位律、结合律给出其范畴公理，两个分量投影保持这些运算，故 $\\operatorname{dom},\\operatorname{cod}$ 是函子。完整标签与 [[16-df-codomain-fibration]]、[[16-df-display-fibration]] 的编码一致；此构造本身不需要拉回。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B","display":false},{"tex":"\\chi:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B^{\\to}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal B^\\to","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{cod}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{dom}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal B","display":false},{"tex":"s,t,e,c","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal B","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle d,d',a,b\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"(a,b):d\\to d'","display":false},{"tex":"\\pi_X,\\{X\\},\\{f\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\chi","display":false},{"tex":"X,Y\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E","display":false},{"tex":"f:X\\to Y","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cat}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cartesian}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CompCat}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Fib}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PbSq}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Functor}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\nO_\\to&\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Mor}\\mathcal B,\\\\\nM_\\to&\\coloneqq\\{\\langle d,d',a,b\\rangle\\mid d,d'\\in O_\\to\\land\na\\in\\mathcal B(sd,sd')\\land b\\in\\mathcal B(td,td')\\land d'a=bd\\},\\\\\ns_\\to\\langle d,d',a,b\\rangle&\\coloneqq d,\\qquad\nt_\\to\\langle d,d',a,b\\rangle\\coloneqq d',\\\\\ne_\\to(d)&\\coloneqq\\langle d,d,e(sd),e(td)\\rangle,\\\\\nc_\\to(\\langle d',d'',a',b'\\rangle,\\langle d,d',a,b\\rangle)\n&\\coloneqq\\langle d,d'',c(a',a),c(b',b)\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathcal B^\\to&\\coloneqq\\langle O_\\to,M_\\to,s_\\to,t_\\to,e_\\to,c_\\to\\rangle,\\\\\n\\operatorname{dom}_0(d)&\\coloneqq sd,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{dom}_1\\langle d,d',a,b\\rangle\\coloneqq a,\\\\\n\\operatorname{cod}_0(d)&\\coloneqq td,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{cod}_1\\langle d,d',a,b\\rangle\\coloneqq b,\\\\\n\\operatorname{dom}&\\coloneqq\\langle\\operatorname{dom}_0,\\operatorname{dom}_1\\rangle,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{cod}\\coloneqq\\langle\\operatorname{cod}_0,\\operatorname{cod}_1\\rangle,\\\\\n\\pi_X&\\coloneqq\\chi X,\\qquad\\{X\\}\\coloneqq\\operatorname{dom}_0(\\chi X),\\qquad\n\\{f\\}\\coloneqq\\operatorname{dom}_1(\\chi f),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Cat}(\\mathcal B^\\to)&,\\qquad\n\\mathrm{Functor}(\\operatorname{dom},\\mathcal B^\\to,\\mathcal B),\\qquad\n\\mathrm{Functor}(\\operatorname{cod},\\mathcal B^\\to,\\mathcal B).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}comprehension\\text{-}category}\\vdash\\quad \\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{CompCat}(p,\\chi)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{Fib}(p)\\land\\operatorname{cod}\\chi=p\\\\\n&\\land(\\forall X,Y\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E)\n(\\forall f\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(X,Y))\\bigl(\\mathrm{Cartesian}_p(f)\\Rightarrow\n\\mathrm{PbSq}_{\\mathcal B}(\\{f\\},\\pi_X;\\pi_Y,pf)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{dom},\\operatorname{cod}","display":false},{"tex":"\\{-\\}=\\operatorname{dom}\\chi","display":false}],"bytes":3974,"backlinks":[{"id":"3791ea7b3d0077ae","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{CompCat}(p,\\chi)$，固定提升选择。$W_X=\\pi_X^*X$，$\\kappa_X:W_X\\to X$ 是所选笛卡尔箭头，$\\pi_{W_X},\\{\\kappa_X\\}:\\{W_X\\}\\rightrightarrows\\{X\\}$ 是其理解拉回的投影。定义和笛卡尔性采用 [[16-df-comprehension-category]]、[[16-df-cartesian-morphism]]。"},{"id":"c5b7418489e74141","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"co